-- ============================================================================
-- HostEze — full database schema
--
-- Regenerated by replaying the complete migration history (backend/migrations/
-- and backend/db/migrations/) into a clean PostgreSQL 15 database and dumping
-- the result. Covers all 28 tables the app uses (the previous hand-written
-- schema.sql only had 7 and had drifted badly from production).
--
-- To recreate a local DB:   createdb hosteze_dev && psql -d hosteze_dev -f db/schema.sql
-- To regenerate from prod:  pg_dump --schema-only --no-owner --no-privileges "$DATABASE_URL"
-- ============================================================================

